<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_7 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>你一记灵巧旋腕便卸开了他的擒拿，林恩眼中闪过赞赏，顺势将你揽进怀里护住。<span class="green">掌心相抵的温度令人倍感踏实。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	重心转得急了些，脚踝在胶垫上崴了一下。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>眼疾手快一把托住你的腰。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
