:: MP RelDay Ash 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>林间细雨沾湿了青苔石阶，<<else>>深林树影穿过茂密的树冠，<</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>正带着猎犬修补石屋后方的防风木篱。看见你走来，他把一双厚实的鹿皮手套递给你：「山里起了风，帮我把这几根松木桩绑牢。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回阿什身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_7 is 1>>
今日已见过面，不必再打扰。
<br>
<<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-7">
<<tendingicon>><<link "打十字桩结 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-7">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_7 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>木篱在山风中稳如磐石，阿什伸手替你拂去发梢落叶，眼底冰霜尽数化作温柔。<span class="green">林间清风吹散了你连日的疲惫。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	松木树皮粗糙，隔着手套仍硌痛了虎口。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>接过麻绳替你收紧最后一扣。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "铺满犬窝 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-7">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_7 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>松针散发出干爽暖香，猎犬亲昵地蹭着你的小腿，阿什递给你一碗热姜汤。<span class="green">深林石屋俨然成了你们安心的家。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	松针里混着半截荆棘刺，扎了一下手腕。<span class="red">你挑出棘刺准备把松针抖匀。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

