<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>夜色深沉的守林人石屋里，<<else>>壁炉篝火噼啪作响的石屋内，<</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>从鹿皮行囊里取出一盏镌刻着古树纹的小巧随身铜灯，挂在你的腰间：「不管你在镇上还是林子里，看到这盏灯就像我在你身边。」
