	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	灯罩余温尚高，指尖碰上去微微发烫。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>忙握住你的手指吹了吹热气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
