<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_8 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_8_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>宣纸上的古符文清晰如印，阿什低头吻了吻你的额角，将博物馆结清的稿酬交给你保管。<<else>>宣纸上的古符文清晰如印，阿什低头轻轻吻了吻你的额角。<</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><span class="green">幽静夜林里只剩彼此安稳的呼吸。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	宣纸边角受潮微卷，镇纸没能一下压严。<span class="red">你移近火炉准备把宣纸烘平。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
